comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-23T06:43:08.310Z",codex-agent,"GitHub #154 source inspection confirms trim() removes meaningful root suffixes. Plan: real-Git helper and installed-CLI regressions, same-repository rename control, and preservation of missing-repository and unknown-base errors. Related original feature: pm-context-ax7z."
  "2026-10-23T06:46:02.433Z",codex-agent,"Regression-first reproduction: node --test --test-name-pattern='trailing-whitespace' test/file-focus.test.ts fails 2/2 on the original implementation: helper throws UNKNOWN_BASE and installed CLI exits 2 with the Git-repository error. The pinned SDK also trims host context; fixtures initialize via the real SDK then rename the same repository to isolate file focus. Fix removes only Git's terminating newline and recovers an exact cwd root only when it matches the host context."
  "2026-10-23T06:50:23.713Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral revert proof: reverted only resolveFileFocus root-discovery statements to the original trim() implementation, preserving its compatible signature and all tests; rebuilt dist. node --test --test-name-pattern=trailing-whitespace test/file-focus.test.ts failed 2/2 (0 pass), exit 1: helper UNKNOWN_BASE and installed CLI exit 2. Restored the fix and rebuilt dist. Positive helper coverage includes space, tab and newline suffixes with unchanged-HEAD rename controls. Typecheck, test compilation and docstring lint pass."
  "2026-10-23T06:52:53.221Z",codex-agent,"Out-of-scope SDK initialization behavior is tracked separately by pm-context-2cx5. Local strict health has the already tracked pm-context-595f host-extension skew and fence drift; no history, dependency pin, or merge configuration remediation is included. CI uses its fresh checkout as the full-gate authority."
  "2026-10-23T06:59:30.193Z",codex-agent,"CI evidence: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-context/actions/runs/39914505693 passed npm and Bun release:check on Node 22 and 26 at 1a7116a, each 393/393 with zero failures/skips. Fresh-checkout tracker health, committed-dist identity, changelog and no-Git acceptance pass. PR https://github.com/unbraind/pm-context/pull/166 includes both fixes. Local strict-health findings remain the pre-existing pm-context-595f follow-up."
  "2026-10-23T07:02:00.181Z",codex-agent,"Local linked verification passed: pm test pm-context-gyq1 --run --progress executed npm run build && node --test --test-name-pattern=trailing-whitespace test/file-focus.test.ts, 2/2 tests with zero failures/skips, exit 0. The shared linked file-focus suite also passed 23/23. Result tracking is disabled; this comment retains the execution evidence without configuration changes. Helper space/tab/newline suffixes preserve exact roots across same-HEAD rename controls; installed CLI changed and explicit-file selectors pass. Both fixes and rebuilt distribution are ready for orchestrator review; leave items open."
